rc=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783990/extras/e9f8a9ec65a27bc4d13a4c7c72bc66ed.mp4?t=1712208185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >chapter-6)coming Soon</h2></strong></h2>-Prepare for what's next as Chapter 6 approaches. Will it bring a challenging boss fight or another twist in your journey?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All the Best, Adventurer, In Your Journey.</strong></h2>",
